  - TV-STUDIO-BOOT-001
  - TV-DESK-STRUCT-001
  - TV-DATASET-SCOPE-001 (partial: ensures dataset value is used downstream)

## Requirements covered

- STUDIO-001
- STUDIO-002 (partial)

